WEBVTT

00:09:58.594 --> 00:10:01.694
but I will tell you,
you will be damned if you do not try.

00:10:02.482 --> 00:10:07.591
(Applause)

00:10:07.615 --> 00:10:09.488
The second is fear.

00:10:09.512 --> 00:10:10.846
And fear is real.

00:10:11.267 --> 00:10:12.725
It is paralyzing.

00:10:12.749 --> 00:10:13.982
It is terrifying.

00:10:14.433 --> 00:10:16.433
But it can also be energizing,

00:10:16.919 --> 00:10:19.028
because once you know
what you're afraid of,

00:10:19.052 --> 00:10:21.379
you can figure out how to get around it.

00:10:21.403 --> 00:10:23.069
And the third is fatigue.

00:10:23.942 --> 00:10:26.709
Sometimes you just get tired of trying.

00:10:27.314 --> 00:10:31.145
You get tired of reading
about processes and politics